" end="00:13.420"> the</span><span begin="00:13.480" end="00:13.690"> way</span><span begin="00:14.390" end="00:14.620"> he's</span><span begin="00:14.700" end="00:14.930"> telling</span><span begin="00:14.970" end="00:16.250"> me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.250" end="00:19.310"><span begin="00:16.250" end="00:16.260">My</span><span begin="00:16.270" end="00:16.350"> ass</span><span begin="00:16.380" end="00:16.580"> looks</span><span begin="00:16.620" end="00:16.810"> good</span><span begin="00:17.090" end="00:17.150"> in</span><span begin="00:17.200" end="00:17.470"> these</span><span begin="00:17.530" end="00:17.800"> ripped</span><span begin="00:17.870" end="00:18.030"> blue</span><span begin="00:18.070" end="00:19.310"> jeans</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.310" end="00:22.570"><span begin="00:19.310" end="00:19.320">My</span><span begin="00:19.340" end="00:19.540"> cheeks</span><span begin="00:19.600" end="00:19.670"> are</span><span begin="00:19.710" end="00:19.850"> red</span><span begin="00:20.070" end="00:20.250"> like</span><span begin="00:20.330" end="00:20.570"> cherries</span><span begin="00:20.610" end="00:20.670"> in</span><span begin="00:20.750" end="00:20.870"> the</span><span begin="00:20.920" end="00:22.420"> spring</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.570" end="00:26.110"><span begin="00:22.570" end="00:22.790">Body's</span><span begin="00:22.840" end="00:22.880"> a</span><span begin="00:22.930" end="00:23.120"> work</span><span begin="00:23.210" end="00:23.350"> of</span><span begin="00:23.440" end="00:23.570"> art</span><span begin="00:23.660" end="00:23.980"> you'd</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.230"> die</span><span begin="00:24.310" end="00:24.430"> to</span><span begin="00:24.520" end="00:26.020"> see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.110" end="00:29.260"><span begin="00:26.110" end="00:27.460">Untouched,</span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:29.260"> XO</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.260" end="00:32.180"><span begin="00:29.260" end="00:29.720">Young</span><span begin="00:29.840" end="00:30.050"> lust,</span><span begin="00:30.430" end="00:30.880"> let's-</span><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:32.180"> (ah)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.180" end="00:35.390"><span begin="00:32.180" end="00:32.240">When</span><span begin="00:32.250" end="00:32.320"> we</span><span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.470"> drive</span><span begin="00:32.510" end="00:32.570"> in</span><span begin="00:32.660" end="00:32.830"> your</span><span begin="00:32.920" end="00:33.150"> car,</span><span begin="00:33.340" end="00:33.490"> I'm</span><span begin="00:33.580" end="00:33.780"> your</span><span begin="00:33.850" end="00:34.100"> baby</span><span begin="00:34.220" end="00:34.370"> (so</span><span begin="00:34.430" end="00:35.390"> sweet)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.390" end="00:38.470"><span begin="00:35.390" end="00:35.460">Losing</span><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:35.570"> all</span><span begin="00:35.600" end="00:35.690"> my</span><span begin="00:35.750" end="00:36.260"> innocence</span><span begin="00:36.400" end="00:36.540"> in</span><span begin="00:36.620" end="00:36.760"> the</span><span begin="00:36.820" end="00:37.100"> back</span><span begin="00:37.160" end="00:38.470"> seat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.470" end="00:41.700"><span begin="00:38.470" end="00:38.500">Say</span><span begin="00:38.510" end="00:38.590"> you</span><span begin="00:38.630" end="00:38.770"> love,</span><span begin="00:38.990" end="00:39.250"> say</span><span begin="00:39.290" end="00:39.450"> you</span><span begin="00:39.520" end="00:39.750"> love,</span><span begin="00:39.890" end="00:40.110"> say</span><span begin="00:40.170" end="00:40.290"> you</span><span begin="00:40.340" end="00:40.490"> love</span><span begin="00:40.550" end="00:40.790"> me</span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:40.950"> (love</span><span begin="00:40.990" end="00:41.700"> me)</span><