2.950" end="00:53.070"> you</span><span begin="00:53.150" end="00:53.290"> love</span><span begin="00:53.360" end="00:53.550"> me</span><span begin="00:53.600" end="00:53.720"> (love</span><span begin="00:53.770" end="00:54.380"> me)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.380" end="00:58.000"><span begin="00:54.380" end="00:54.450">Losing</span><span begin="00:54.540" end="00:54.610"> all</span><span begin="00:54.630" end="00:54.730"> my</span><span begin="00:54.770" end="00:55.250"> innocence</span><span begin="00:55.330" end="00:55.550"> in</span><span begin="00:55.630" end="00:55.810"> the</span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.050"> back</span><span begin="00:56.100" end="00:57.600"> seat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.000" end="01:01.050"><span begin="00:58.000" end="00:58.350">Break</span><span begin="00:58.410" end="00:58.470"> all</span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.640"> the</span><span begin="00:58.670" end="00:58.850"> rules</span><span begin="00:59.270" end="00:59.660"> 'til</span><span begin="00:59.710" end="00:59.810"> we</span><span begin="00:59.870" end="01:00.010"> get</span><span begin="01:00.070" end="01:01.050"> caught</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.050" end="01:04.350"><span begin="01:01.050" end="01:01.140">Fog</span><span begin="01:01.190" end="01:01.300"> up</span><span begin="01:01.340" end="01:01.440"> the</span><span begin="01:01.470" end="01:01.850"> windows</span><span begin="01:01.960" end="01:02.050"> in</span><span begin="01:02.100" end="01:02.250"> the</span><span begin="01:02.310" end="01:02.790"> parking</span><span begin="01:02.890" end="01:04.350"> lot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.350" end="01:07.250"><span begin="01:04.350" end="01:04.840">Summer</span><span begin="01:04.940" end="01:05.130"> love</span><span begin="01:05.480" end="01:05.720"> (ah,</span><span begin="01:05.800" end="01:06.060"> ah),</span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:07.250"> sexy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01: