.880"> ah</span><span begin="01:21.980" end="01:23.430"> (go)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.430" end="01:26.680"><span begin="01:23.430" end="01:23.460">When</span><span begin="01:23.490" end="01:23.530"> we</span><span begin="01:23.560" end="01:23.710"> drive</span><span begin="01:23.770" end="01:23.930"> in</span><span begin="01:23.980" end="01:24.180"> your</span><span begin="01:24.290" end="01:24.500"> car,</span><span begin="01:24.560" end="01:24.770"> I'm</span><span begin="01:24.860" end="01:25.030"> your</span><span begin="01:25.090" end="01:25.310"> baby</span><span begin="01:25.410" end="01:25.680"> (so</span><span begin="01:25.760" end="01:26.680"> sweet)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.680" end="01:29.630"><span begin="01:26.680" end="01:26.760">Losing</span><span begin="01:26.790" end="01:26.970"> all</span><span begin="01:27.050" end="01:27.140"> my</span><span begin="01:27.190" end="01:27.650"> innocence</span><span begin="01:27.810" end="01:27.880"> in</span><span begin="01:27.940" end="01:28.130"> the</span><span begin="01:28.180" end="01:28.380"> back</span><span begin="01:28.450" end="01:29.630"> seat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.630" end="01:32.700"><span begin="01:29.630" end="01:29.650">Say</span><span begin="01:29.680" end="01:29.750"> you</span><span begin="01:29.780" end="01:30.000"> love,</span><span begin="01:30.070" end="01:30.470"> say</span><span begin="01:30.550" end="01:30.720"> you</span><span begin="01:30.800" end="01:31.190"> love,</span><span begin="01:31.250" end="01:31.360"> say</span><span begin="01:31.410" end="01:31.540"> you</span><span begin="01:31.590" end="01:31.760"> love</span><span begin="01:31.830" end="01:32.020"> me</span><span begin="01:32.090" end="01:32.310"> (love</span><span begin="01:32.350" end="01:32.850"> me)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.700" end="01:36.020"><span begin="01:32.700" end="01:32.800">Losing</span><span begin="01:32.880" end="01:32.970"> all</span><sp